[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-106663"] :question/worked-solution "An inhibited growth initial value problem has the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=k(a-y),\\,y(0)={y}_{0}\n$$\n\nwhere $k>0$ is a constant of proportionality, and $a>y$ for all $t\\ge 0.$\n\nFrom the given options, the only inhibited growth problem is\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=3(250-y),\\,y(0)=150.\n$$\n\nIn this case, $k=3,a=250,$ and ${y}_{0}=150.$ Notice that $a>{y}_{0},$ which is required for inhibited growth. \n\nThe other options do not represent inhibited growth. In particular, the initial value problem\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=3(250-y),\\,y(0)=400,\n$$\n\ndoes *not* represent inhibited growth model because ${y}_{0}=400>a=250.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-37180/selection/8ddaaa3c22c182078534a19f8f7ed63f84d580d196766a60c493201bcad522d9" :answer/id #uuid "08ff9d27-8424-57e8-b861-0e05afdf7397" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dP}{dt}=2\\,580-0.6P,\\,P(0)=4\\,400" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37180/selection/a34c654dcac9001f079ec25779eac0f8058d7e177e2ae93929dc4dcc6593bbe6" :answer/id #uuid "c3ad886b-98d3-5405-acc9-1f28973c2b21" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dP}{dt}=16\\,256-4P,\\,P(0)=4\\,070" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37180/selection/5f0a71d842ee5c32d48b20272af32a240f9b54f86154740c26f11f2bc83f53d7" :answer/id #uuid "79f5c0e5-888b-5885-8f9a-109a0df38520" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dP}{dt}=0.5P-1\\,23,\\,P(0)=2\\,500" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37180/selection/68057005a1a5d1829183e2576095ff2c02215b574ddfcb08e8b9d3897f2d661f" :answer/id #uuid "dac94d52-d256-569b-b8b5-9de8af332f00" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dP}{dt}=9P-6\\,066,\\,P(0)=680" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37180/selection/38d9b4a80e5c36380af5db5802ed305f28716ddc3b8e505e257a56860c5e8b5a" :answer/id #uuid "bd76e344-9cc5-5e4f-b6bb-25d